WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.900 line:76%
Start here has the setup steps. Click
Try the simulator to practise without an arm.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:06.900 line:76%
In USB connection, choose your follower.
Click Scan ports and pick the USB adapter.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:09.400 line:76%
If the arm is calibrated, click Connect by USB,
then Read current pose.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.400 line:76%
For a new arm, choose Calibrate new.
Support the arm as torque releases.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:15.100 line:76%
To reuse a file from this same arm,
choose Restore saved calibration.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.700 line:76%
In Simulation, the editor has a two-move route.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:22.100 line:76%
Click Preview in 3D. Gold marks the moving motor.

00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:23.400 line:76%
Choose Go to Deployment.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.400 line:76%
With a calibrated arm connected,
choose Prepare deployment.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:29.200 line:76%
Review each target with your teacher, confirm once,
and watch the live 3D feedback.

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.900 line:76%
In Settings, use Import JSON
to load a saved calibration.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:33.600 line:76%
Save the file and assign it to your follower.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:35.900 line:76%
Return to Start here for the step-by-step guide.
